{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16803","headline":"赋四相诗 礼部尚书门下侍郎平章事李岘 · 皇甫澈","name":"赋四相诗 礼部尚书门下侍郎平章事李岘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时来遇明圣，道济宁邦国。\n猗欤瑚琏器，竭我股肱力。\n进贤黜不肖，错枉举诸直。\n宦官既却坐，权奸亦移职。\n载践每若惊，三已无愠色。\n昭昭垂宪章，来世实作则。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}